## sn55.27
sn55.27:1.1 | S: At Sāvatthī. | T: At Sāvatthī.
sn55.27:1.2 | S: Now at that time the householder Anāthapiṇḍika was sick, suffering, gravely ill. | T: Now, on that occasion Anāthapiṇḍika the householder was diseased, in pain, severely ill.
sn55.27:1.3 | S: Then he addressed a man, | T: Then he said to one of his men,
