sn55.27:1.7 | S: And then say: | T: Then say:
sn55.27:1.8 | S: ‘Sir, please visit him at his home out of sympathy.’” | T: ‘It would be good if Ven. Ānanda would visit Anāthapiṇḍika’s home, out of sympathy for him.’”
